Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/computerphysicslab/goCrawler

Package: gocrawler
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: topic-restricted crawler for curated text corpora
 goCrawler starts from seed URLs, downloads pages, and keeps only documents
 that pass language, length, relevance and uniqueness filters. It writes a
 curated corpus, token frequencies and a ranking to disk. The default cache
 is a local SQLite file; Redis is optional.
